      '      "confidence": 4, "requiresHumanReview": false }',
      "  ]",
      "}",
      "",
      "RULES:",
      "1. `anchorText` MUST be copied verbatim from the document below, and MUST appear in the",
      "   paragraph named by `paragraphId`. If you cannot quote it exactly, omit the edit.",
